# Nursing Education and Genetics: Miles To Go before We Sleep.

**Authors:** Monsen, Rita Black, Anderson, Gwen, New, Frances, Ledbetter, Steven, Frazier, Lisa Gordon, Smith, Mary E., Wilson, Michael

## Abstract
A survey of 42 state boards of nursing and examiniaton of 30 textbooks found that, despite advances in genetics research, few boards require genetics in nursing curricula. Textbooks had minimal genetics content. (SK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ598612

